Maps Expanded
=============

This project is **Maps Expanded** — a standalone SPT mod (client + optional
server mod). It is not DynamicMaps, or DynamicMaps Extended.

Maps Expanded includes MIT-licensed software adapted from those upstream projects.
Attribution for that incorporated code is retained below as required by MIT.

